  "question": "求 $\\frac{1 + \\frac{\\pi^4}{5!} + \\frac{\\pi^8}{9!} + \\frac{\\pi^{12}}{13!} + \\cdots}{\\frac{1}{3!} + \\frac{\\pi^4}{7!} + \\frac{\\pi^8}{11!} + \\frac{\\pi^{12}}{15!} + \\cdots}$ 之值.",
  "answer": "收敛，设 $p, q$ 分别是分子与分母级数的和，则",
